model worlds
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-25
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  note "T's vectors for MB2's two G6 survivors (issue #108, invented): a scenario's replace rule and its band table are its own; read in the model's world, from the scenario's file or through a diff against the model, the model's rule and table answer (L §6.4; read/rules.rs:39, read/bands.rs:65)"

source card "T's card (invented)"

unit DUK: currency minor 0.01

input base_pay: money DUK

input bonus: money DUK

input revenue: money DUK

band contribution(x: money DUK): money DUK

def pay: money DUK at reader
  rule base = base_pay

version facts
  cite card
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  base_pay = 1000 "the base pay"
  bonus = 100 "the raise"
  revenue = 50000 "the revenue"
  contribution: (-inf, 60000] = 300 "the model's table: 300.00"
  contribution: (60000, inf) = 500 "the model's table: 500.00"
